16. tup-pi 6.KAM₂ ša₂ naq-bi e-mu-ru [EŠ₂.GAR₃ {d}GIŠ-gim₂-m]aš
#tr.en.(r vi 17): Tablet VI, ‘He who saw the Deeps’, [series of] Gilgameš. Written and checked according to its original.
17. LIBIR.RA.BI₂.GIM AB.SAR-ma BA.AN.E₃#
18. KUR# {m}AN.ŠAR₂-DU₃-[A]
#tr.en.(r vi 19): Palace of Aššurbanipal, [king of the] world, king of Assyria.
19. [MAN Š]U₂ MAN {kur}AN.ŠAR₂{ki}
$ end of side
#note: See @bib{RN117@736 fn. 1}: “The property label, which is Assurbanipal colophon a = @bib{RN497@no. 317}, was incised on the tablet after the clay had hardened.”

